17592186045465 13194139534997 true] [17592186325632 1100 "Let $p=⟨1,\\sqrt{6},3⟩$ and $q=⟨-7,\\sqrt{6},3⟩.$ Find ${\\text{comp}}_{q}\\,p+{\\text{comp}}_{p}\\,q.$" 13194139534997 true] [17592186325632 1113 #uuid "f391da49-b858-5b82-bce0-f8608ff7cc98" 13194139534997 true] [17592186325632 1145 "Using the formula for the scalar projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{q}\\,p & =\\frac{p\\cdot q}{|\\,q\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{p}_{x}{q}_{x}+{p}_{y}{q}_{y}+{p}_{z}{q}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{q}_{x}^{2}+{q}_{y}^{2}+{q}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1\\cdot (-7)+\\sqrt{6}\\cdot \\sqrt{6}+3\\cdot 3}{\\sqrt{(-7)^{2}+{\\sqrt{6}}^{2}+{3}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{64}} \\\\  & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{p}\\,q & =\\frac{p\\cdot q}{|\\,p\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{p}_{x}{q}_{x}+{p}_{y}{q}_{y}+{p}_{z}{q}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{p}_{x}^{2}+{p}_{y}^{2}+{p}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+{\\sqrt{6}}^{2}+{3}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{16}} \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{q}\\,p+{\\text{comp}}_{p}\\,q & =1+2 \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534997 true] [17592186325633 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325634 13194139534997 true] [17592186325633 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325635 13194139534997 true] [17592186325633 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325636 13194139534997 true] [17592186325633 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325637 13194139534997 true] [17592186325633 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325638 13194139534997 true] [17592186325633 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534997 true] [17592186325633 1041 "selection" 13194139534997 true] [17592186325633 1104 #edb/ref 17592186325634 13194139534997 true] [17592186325633 1110 #uuid "0e75fe42-7171-56bb-82e1-1ce9148667d1" 13194139534997 true] [17592186325634 1034 "3" 13194139534997 true] [17592186325634 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534997 true] [17592186325634 1111 #uuid "b88393da-6120-5acc-9337-a4c29e26e675" 13194139534997 true] [17592186325635 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}" 1319413